    "Prior to their construction, a schedule specifying all external materials (not limited to bricks; mortar; and, powder coated aluminium doors, windows and spandrel panels) shall  be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. The development\rshall be implemented in accordance with the approved details and permanently maintained as such.\r\rReason: to ensure a satisfactory appearance.\r\r",
    "Prior to their construction or insertion, additional drawings that show details of proposed windows; doors; spandrel panels; parapet; cills; lintels; rainwater goods; decorative brickwork panels; and, recessed entrance by section and elevation at a scales of between 1:20 and 1:1 as appropriate shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. Works shall be implemented in accordance with the approved details and shall be permanently maintained as such.\r\rReason: to ensure a satisfactory appearance.\r"
